"""
Checked public surface for Hees.ai.

The root re-exports the nominal identifier vocabulary, the structural kernel (``runtime``), the governed continuity
kernel (RFC 013), the governed memory-operation kernel (RFC 014), the host-held witness key types those two take,
retrieval-result admission into governed memory context (the runtime part of RFC 003), the generic governed-profile
evaluator (RFC 015), guided programs (``programme``), the package loader, hyperquant retrieval, and the bounded
Console profile (RFC 010). RFC 013 to 015 are Draft and RFC 003 is partly implemented: their exports are checked here
but their contracts may still change. Every export below is deliberate; internal stages, intermediate projections,
authority-bearing constructors, and the functions that stamp or verify a witness are not re-exported.
"""

